Description: Keep Debian install layout independent of interpreter patches
 The Debian setuptools patch accesses install_layout and prefix_option on the
 install command. Supply those attributes and the explicit deb layout even
 when the interpreter has no optional _distutils_system_mod or deb_system
 sysconfig scheme. Preserve explicit prefixes and ordinary upstream layouts.
Author: Robolightning <irobolightning@gmail.com>
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-11-12

--- a/setuptools/_distutils/command/install.py
+++ b/setuptools/_distutils/command/install.py
@@ -46,6 +46,16 @@
